<title>USA: HFB Financial Corp Q2 Dec 31 net widens.</title>
<headline>HFB Financial Corp Q2 Dec 31 net widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLESBORO, Ky. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			    375			154</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.25		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			    163			408</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The first six months of 1996 included a charge of $706,000 to rebuild the Savings Association Insurance Fund and a provision for loan losses of $78,000.  Without these extraordinary charges, earnings per share would have been approximately $1.05 for the first six months of 1996.</p>
